  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/c4vmDfS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/608760849544249375?color=orange&amp;label=Discord&amp;logo=Discord\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/cweckerl/simplefarming/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/actions/workflow/status/cweckerl/simplefarming/gradle.yml\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/cweckerl/simplefarming/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/cweckerl/simplefarming\" alt=\"issues\"></a></p><p>Simple Farming 是一款适用于 Minecraft 1.14+ 版本的农业模组。</p><h5><strong>特色功能</strong></h5><ul>\n<li>新增作物</li>\n<li>浆果灌木丛</li>\n<li>果树</li>\n<li>新式餐点</li>\n<li>酿酒系统</li>\n</ul><h5><strong>兼容模组</strong></h5><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items (JEI)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppleSkin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/right-click-get-crops\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Right Click, Get Crops</a></li>\n</ul><h5><strong>资源包</strong></h5><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/beautycrops\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BeautyCrops</a></li>\n</ul><h5><strong>意见反馈</strong></h5><p>任何问题请提交至 GitHub <a href=\"https://github.com/cweckerl/simplefarming/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题追踪系统</a>。若想建议新功能，欢迎加入社群 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/c4vmDfS\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>。</p><h5><strong>免责声明</strong></h5><p>CurseForge 是唯一发布模组构建的网站，从其他网站下载模组时请谨慎。</p><h5><strong>贡献者</strong></h5><p>感谢您对 Simple Farming 的支持！若想参与模组翻译，请加入 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/c4vmDfS\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 获取更多信息。<a href=\"https://github.com/cweckerl/simplefarming/blob/1.15/CONTRIBUTORS.md\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>为持续更新的贡献者名单。</p>",
